('haldi-mehndi-album-psd','Haldi & Mehndi Album PSD','Haldi and Mehndi Album PSD Free Download – Bright 12x36 Spreads','12x36',lambda d:any(w in TXT(d) for w in('haldi','mehndi','mehendi')),'Haldi and Mehndi functions are full of colour: turmeric yellow, marigold orange and henna green. These album PSDs use brighter palettes and playful ornaments so the pre-wedding rituals get spreads that feel different from the main ceremony pages.'),
